    "notes": "Hard counters beat decisively; soft counters are situational. Tier 1 openers (Marine/Stalker/Ling), tier 2 tech (Adept/Lurker/Liberator/Immortal), tier 3 finishers (Colossus/Thor/Brood Lord). Direct Strike: mass T1 can overwhelm a few high-tech units if enemy skipped tier; Phoenix does not counter Mutalisks; scan for cloaked T2. Wave platform is an 18×12 diamond grid per player (216 cells for ground and air); small units ~9 cells, massive ~36."
  },
